cts the two eras has reopened, allowing Towa to be reunited with Setsuna, who is now a Demon Slayer working for Kohaku. But to Towa’s shock, Setsuna appears to have lost all memories of her older sister.\n\nJoined by Moroha, the daughter of Inuyasha and Kagome, the three young women travel between the two eras on an adventure to regain their missing past.\n\n(Source: VIZ Media)"},"tags":[{"name":"Historical","rank":88,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Female Protagonist","rank":86,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Magic","rank":76,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Demons","rank":74,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Youkai","rank":74,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Primarily Female Cast","rank":71,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Memory Manipulation","rank":60,"spoiler":true},{"name":"Swordplay","rank":60,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Amnesia","rank":55,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Tomboy","rank":53,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Isekai","rank":52,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Time Manipulation","rank":46,"spoiler":true},{"name":"Archery","rank":40,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Kemonomimi","rank":33,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Shounen","rank":20,"spoiler":false}],"titles":{"display":"Yashahime: Princess Half-Demon","english":"Yashahime: Princess Half-Demon","native":"半妖の夜叉姫","romaji":"Hanyou no Yashahime","synonyms":[{"language":"zh","source":"bangumi","value":"半妖的夜叉姬"},{"language":null,"source":"bangumi","value":"半妖の夜叉姫 -戦国御伽草子-"},{"language":null,"source":"bangumi","value":"半妖的夜叉姬 -战国御伽草子-"},{"language":null,"source":"bangumi","value":"Han`you no Yashahime: Sengoku Otogizoushi"}]},"trailer":{"id":"yc3356aM6gI","site":"youtube","thumbnail":"https://i.ytimg.com/vi/yc3356aM6gI/hqdefault.jpg"},"visibility":"general"}